# SG-173 live DOM structural extract (sanitized)

Method: headless `google-chrome` 150 (`--headless=new --dump-dom --virtual-time-budget=10000`),
against a disposable vite dev server (`localhost:5173`) whose source tree is byte-identical to the
served image tree (`git diff 3ae5541..HEAD -- backend frontend` = 0 lines), calling the live backend
at `127.0.0.1:8003`. Read-only: GET navigation only, zero clicks, zero keys, zero writes.
HOME redirected to `/tmp/opencode/chromehome` (host `$HOME` is read-only in this lane; Chrome's
wrapper could not start otherwise — F-SG173-5). Raw DOMs (~11–18 KiB each) stayed in `/tmp/opencode`;
only counts/states below are committed. UUIDs masked; no product names, photos or transcripts.

## /review/<candidate-A>?household_id=<hh>  (embedded review_task_ids=1; ALL its tasks live-resolved)

- blocked sentence "Acceptance is blocked until the open review task(s) are resolved." count = 1
- Accept button present, `disabled` attribute = True
- Inbox links: back-link `href="/inbox"`; SG-171 affordance `href="/inbox?household_id=<uuid>"`

